<title>USA: Temple University Hospital $40 mln repriced.</title>
<headline>Temple University Hospital $40 mln repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. said it repriced and restructured a Temple University Hospital revenue bond issue, raising the size of the issue to $39.8 million from $39.02 million, adding a 2023 maturity and raising the yield in 2027 to 5.975 percent from 5.95 percent.</p>
<p>RE: $39,870,000*</p>
<p>THE HOSPITALS AND HIGHER EDUCATION FACILITIES</p>
<p>AUTHORITY OF PHILADELPHIA</p>
